    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Demetrius",
      "key": "fall_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Let's see... perhaps the nitrogen fixation level is affected by nematode secretions...$u#$b#Oh! Sorry. I was pondering some data and I didn't notice you there.#$e#Do you need anything?",
      "translation": "Tak se podíváme... Možná je míra fixace dusíku ovlivněna sekrety hlístic...$u#$b#Jé, promiň. Přemýšlel jsem nad daty a ani jsem si tě nevšiml.#$e#Potřebuješ něco?",
      "sourceSHA256": "c37a6d060ba24c279ed84518f23088978e343d4414c94afb1e68df64681a77b6",
      "translationSHA256": "c6c6e3f4c0b9c20c572e7ee4d24ca977abad2cfd7ea200b6af12fd79263c66a0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
