    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Demetrius",
      "key": "winter_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Let's see... if seasonal nitrogen levels could be modeled by a piecewise function...$u#$b#Oh! Sorry. I was analyzing data and I didn't notice you there.#$e#Do you need anything?",
      "translation": "Tak se podíváme... Kdyby se sezónní hladiny dusíku daly modelovat pomocí funkce definované po částech...$u#$b#Jé, promiň. Analyzoval jsem data a ani jsem si tě nevšiml.#$e#Potřebuješ něco?",
      "sourceSHA256": "2b3e2d3db6a0764a7d5ef803bc5efcc0a10ef33f6dc3bbc98b3657133a821958",
      "translationSHA256": "ccfae5f9785700b283dabd25102be2738ae19c1b430117d6c97872bf639ecdcf",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
